prompt_template:
Create one full-bleed {ASPECT_RATIO} original adult anime character key-art poster in the Acid Parallax fused style.
CAMERA FIRST: ultra-wide 14mm fisheye, lens almost touching the nearest hand or prop, which looms enormous and distorted while the body shrinks sharply into depth; strongly tilted horizon and curved edges. Never an eye-level three-quarter view.
DRAWING STYLE: Japanese anime cel illustration with sharp tapered ink lines, thick uneven outer contours, expressive anime eyes and a wide open shouting mouth; not Western comic-book rendering. Red and cyan line-offset ghosting must be clearly visible along the outer contours and hair, like a misregistered print.
Clothing stays fully closed to the throat; no neckline opening.
Subject: {SUBJECT}
Action/camera: {SUBJECT_ACTION}
Structural composition: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
Primary text, exact: "{MAIN_TEXT}" and nothing else; spell it letter by letter exactly as given, never adding, repeating or dropping a letter, and add no other words or letters anywhere. Use enormous heavy black upright Latin block sans, structurally interlocked, every letter identifiable. No slogans or signature tags.
Fusion: R1 supplies acid lime ground, hot magenta splash, black cropped graphic letters and corner brackets; R2 supplies substantial wet cobalt/lime brush swipes plus coarse halftone patches; R3 supplies overhead fisheye, thick uneven hand ink, flat cel shadows and bold flat flower impact shapes; R4 supplies flat yellow and visibly loose red/green/cyan displaced line art along selected contours. Every reference must remain visible. Preserve about 15–22% plain field; texture is localized, not dirt everywhere.
{STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
Exclude: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}
